    failed connect (lazy, per attempt); `Redis__Endpoint` written by both customer.bicep and H4b (same value, documented);
    RedisOptions bound by hand (pre-existing); H1 default-provider test (named in this task's test scope).
    Tests beyond the listed scope (justification): credential-in-endpoint refusal (security guard — a pasted connection
    string must not be used or logged); endpoint-wins-over-connection-string (the T242b no-outage cut-over depends on it);
    null-database contract (guards the DispatchProxy rewrite).
